<html><head><meta charset="UTF-8"></head><body style="font-family:Segoe UI,Arial"><h2>Rooster Pizza &amp; Grill — Rendimiento (API + Frontend)</h2><p style="font-size:12px;color:#475569">API: k6 v2.1.0, 30 iter/rol (backend con OPcache). Frontend: Lighthouse 13 sobre build de <b>producción</b> (brotli + proxy al backend). 9/8/2026, 9:10:53 p. m.<br>Verde ≥90 / ≤100ms · Amarillo 50-89 / ≤250ms · Rojo &lt;50 / &gt;250ms.</p><h3>1) API — tiempo de respuesta por perspectiva (backend)</h3><table style="border-collapse:collapse"><tr><th style="background:#1f2937;color:#fff;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial;font-size:12px;text-align:left">Perspectiva</th><th style="background:#1f2937;color:#fff;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial;font-size:12px;text-align:left">Media ANTES (ms)</th><th style="background:#1f2937;color:#fff;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial;font-size:12px;text-align:left">Media AHORA (ms)</th><th style="background:#1f2937;color:#fff;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial;font-size:12px;text-align:left">Mejora</th></tr><tr><td style="padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial;font-size:12px">Usuario (cliente)</td><td style="padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial;font-size:12px;background:#fef9c3">198</td><td style="padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial;font-size:12px;background:#dcfce7">66</td><td style="padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial;font-size:12px">-67%</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial;font-size:12px">Admin</td><td style="padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial;font-size:12px;background:#fef9c3">248</td><td style="padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial;font-size:12px;background:#dcfce7">68</td><td style="padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial;font-size:12px">-73%</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial;font-size:12px">Superadmin</td><td style="padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial;font-size:12px;background:#fef9c3">221</td><td style="padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial;font-size:12px;background:#dcfce7">56</td><td style="padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial;font-size:12px">-75%</td></tr></table><p style="font-size:11px;color:#64748b">p50 ≈ 50 ms · p95 ≈ 165-177 ms · 0% errores · server-side puro ≈ 14 ms (dashboard). Causa raíz optimizada: OPcache.</p><br><h3>2) Frontend — Core Web Vitals por perspectiva y perfil (Lighthouse, producción)</h3><table style="border-collapse:collapse"><tr><th style="background:#1f2937;color:#fff;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial;font-size:12px;text-align:left">Perspectiva</th><th style="background:#1f2937;color:#fff;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial;font-size:12px;text-align:left">Perfil</th><th style="background:#1f2937;color:#fff;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial;font-size:12px;text-align:left">Ruta</th><th style="background:#1f2937;color:#fff;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial;font-size:12px;text-align:left">Performance</th><th style="background:#1f2937;color:#fff;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial;font-size:12px;text-align:left">Accesib.</th><th style="background:#1f2937;color:#fff;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial;font-size:12px;text-align:left">Best Pr.</th><th style="background:#1f2937;color:#fff;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial;font-size:12px;text-align:left">SEO</th><th style="background:#1f2937;